# Line endings. Everything is stored with LF and checked out with LF, on Windows too: shell scripts (bump-version.sh, run
# under Git Bash) break on CRLF. Windows-only launchers keep CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Binary files are never touched.
*.xlsx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.plugin binary
